[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――そういうわけで、ユリエさんが\n『ランターナ紀行』を書くことになったのよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So, long story short, Jurie has agreed to write \"Travels Through Lantarna.\""
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリオン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marion"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そう。姉さん、あの話を受けたのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I see. She took the commission."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それで、見たこと聞いたことを本にするためにも、\nこの広大なランターナ王国中を巡るんですって",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And to turn everything she sees and hears into a book, she'll be traveling all across the kingdom."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリオン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marion"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ふうん。\n姉さん、また落ち着かないわけね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Figures. She could never sit still for long."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そういう言い方はないんじゃない？\u3000\nまあ、確かにじっとしていられない性分ではあるけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's a bit harsh. Though I suppose you're not wrong—she never could stay in one place."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリオン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marion"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……私も、姉さんの旅についていくわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'm going with her."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、珍しい。\nあなたも何か目的があるの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, that's unexpected. Do you have your own reasons for going?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリオン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marion"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。ちょっと、やりたいことがある",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A few things I want to do."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "旅に同行すれば色々な場所を回れるだろうから、\n欲しい素材も採取できそうだし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Traveling with her means visiting all kinds of places. Should be easy to gather the materials I need."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうね。それなら、いい選択だと思うわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That sounds like a good plan, then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリオン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marion"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "話は聞こえていたわ。\nミルカ、あなたも来るのね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I heard everything. So you're coming too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……うん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yeah."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう、分かったわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "All right, then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人とも、気を付けて行ってきて。\nユリエさん、紀行文の完成、楽しみにしてるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You two take care of yourselves. And Jurie—I'll be looking forward to reading that travelogue."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリオン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marion"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとう、マリオン。\n必ずいいものにするわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks, Marion. I'll make sure it's worth reading."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ミルカ。旅の途中、\n何か困ったことがあれば、すぐに言いなさい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca. If anything goes wrong on the road, tell me right away."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……分かってる。\n姉さんも無理はしないで",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I know. Don't push yourself either."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、約束する",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I promise."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あなたがいてくれるなら、\nどんな困難も乗り越えられる気がする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "With you along, I feel like we can handle anything that comes our way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Good."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それにしても珍しい。\nミルカが一緒に行きたいだなんて",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Still, it's unusual. You actually wanting to come along."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ユリエ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jurie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "別に",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's nothing."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃあ、二人とも。いい旅を",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well then, you two. Safe travels."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリオン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marion"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、行ってくる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks. We're off."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "異邦人の女性。真面目な仕事人間。\nレスナたちからアトリエの管理を任されている",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A wanderer and a dedicated professional. She's been entrusted with managing the atelier in Resna and the others' absence."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリオン・クィン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marion Quinn"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "もの静かな錬金術士。ユリエの妹。\n素直ゆえに発言が辛辣になってしまいがち",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A quiet alchemist and Jurie's younger sister. Her honesty tends to make her words come out sharper than intended."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミルカ・クロッツェ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miruca Crotze"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]